<title>USA: Aladdin says holders sell 2.05 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Aladdin says holders sell 2.05 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Aladdin Knowledge Systems Ltd said on Wednesday certain stockholders sold a total of about 2.05 million ordinary shares for $9.75 per ordinary share, or about $20 million.</p>
<p>The Tel Aviv-based company said the deal was managed by Josepthal Lyon &amp; Ross Inc and Anderson &amp; Strudwick Inc.</p>
<p>The selling stockholders received the Aladdin shares this year in connection with the business combination of Aladdin and FAST Software Security AG of Munich, Germany.</p>
<p>Aladdin issued 3.15 million Aladdin shares to the former FAST shareholders in the purchase.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
